            "commentType": "FUNCTION",
            "texts": [
              {
                "value": "This necrosis-inducing peptide induces a hypersensitive response on Cf-4 tomato genotypes. Race-specific elicitors are compounds which only induce defense responses in genotypes of host plants which are resistant to the pathogenic race that produces the elicitor, but not in susceptible genotypes"
              }
            ]
          }
